#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:274
#: C/index.docbook:274
msgid "The <application>gparted</application> application is the GNOME Partition Editor for creating, reorganizing, and deleting disk partitions."
msgstr ""
"Programmet <application>gparted</application> er partisjonsprogrammet i "
"GNOME for å lage, omorganisere og slette diskpartisjonar."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:278
#: C/index.docbook:278
msgid "A disk device can be subdivided into one or more partitions. The <application>gparted</application> application enables you to change the partition organization on a disk device while preserving the contents of the partition."
msgstr ""
"Ei diskeining kan delast inn i éin eller fleire partisjonar. Med programmet "
"<application>gparted</application> kan du endre inndelinga i partisjonar på "
"ei diskeining og samstundes ta vare på innhaldet i partisjonane."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:289
#: C/index.docbook:289
msgid "Create a partition table on a disk device."
msgstr "Lag ein partisjonstabell på ei diskeining."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:294
#: C/index.docbook:294
msgid "Enable and disable partition flags such as boot and hidden."
msgstr "Slå partisjonsflagg som boot og hidden på og av."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:299
#: C/index.docbook:299
msgid "Perform actions with partitions such as create, delete, resize, move, check, label, copy, and paste."
msgstr ""
"Gjer handlingar med partisjonar, som å lage, slette, endre storleik, flytte,"
" kontrollere, merkje, kopiere og lime inn."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:284
#: C/index.docbook:284
msgid "With <application>gparted</application> you can accomplish the following tasks: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Med <application>gparted</application> kan du gjere desse oppgåvene: "
"<_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: caution/para
#: C/index.docbook:307
#: C/index.docbook:307
msgid "Editing partitions has the potential to cause LOSS of DATA."
msgstr "Endringar i partisjonar kan føre til TAP av DATA."

#. (itstool) path: caution/para
#: C/index.docbook:310
#: C/index.docbook:310
msgid "The <application>gparted</application> application is designed to enable you to edit partitions while reducing the risk of data loss. The application is carefully tested and is used by the GParted project team. However, loss of data might occur due to software bugs, hardware problems, or power failure."
msgstr ""
"Programmet <application>gparted</application> er laga for at du skal kunne "
"endre partisjonar med minst mogleg fare for å miste data. Programmet er "
"grundig testa og vert brukt av dei som lagar GParted. Likevel kan data gå "
"tapt på grunn av programfeil, maskinvareproblem eller straumbrot."

#. (itstool) path: caution/para
#: C/index.docbook:319
#: C/index.docbook:319
msgid "You can help to reduce the risk of data loss by not mounting or unmounting partitions outside of the <application>gparted</application> application while <application>gparted</application> is running."
msgstr ""
"Du kan minske faren for å miste data ved å ikkje montere eller avmontere "
"partisjonar utanfor programmet <application>gparted</application> medan "
"<application>gparted</application> køyrer."

#. (itstool) path: caution/para
#: C/index.docbook:325
#: C/index.docbook:325
msgid "You are advised to BACKUP your DATA before using the <application>gparted</application> application. This is especially true for encrypted data where all of the data can become permanently inaccessible after a failure. Please refer to <ulink type=\"http\" url=\"https://gitlab.com/cryptsetup/cryptsetup/wikis/FrequentlyAskedQuestions\">The Cryptsetup FAQ</ulink> for backup and recovery advice of encrypted data."
msgstr ""
"Du vert råda til å ta SIKKERHEITSKOPI av DATA før du brukar programmet "
"<application>gparted</application>. Det gjeld særleg krypterte data, der "
"alle dataa kan verte utilgjengelege for godt etter ein feil. Sjå <ulink "
"type=\"http\" "
"url=\"https://gitlab.com/cryptsetup/cryptsetup/wikis/FrequentlyAskedQuestions\">The"
" Cryptsetup FAQ</ulink> for råd om sikkerheitskopiering og gjenoppretting av"
" krypterte data."

